Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator at editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistant:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Mga tagasalin ng Typesetter: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee, tommo, Zero_Amamiya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:57.38,italics,,0,0,0,,Isang araw, si Deho ay tinamaan ng matinding tagtuyot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.26,0:01:02.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Napakalakas kaya Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.55,italics,,0,0,0,,ubos
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:15.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Ang mga salamangkero ng Deho ay nagsagawa ng isang mahusay na seremonya,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:17.36,italics,,0,0,0,,upang punuin ng enerhiya ang lawa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:26.62,italics,,0,0,0,,Nagdulot ng malakas na yelo ang ritwal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:39.67,italics,,0,0,0,,Sa lahat ng granizo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.63,italics,,0,0,0,,may isang hindi natunaw
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:49.55,italics,,0,0,0,,Itong granizo ay unang naging apoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:51.52,italics,,0,0,0,,tapos bato,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:53.81,italics,,0,0,0,,at pagkatapos ay sa tubig
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.77,0:01:58.23,italics,,0,0,0,,Tapos bumalik ulit siya sa simula - naging yelo siya
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.11,0:02:01.78,italics,,0,0,0,,Kasabay nito, ang itim na alikabok ay inilabas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:07.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Ang alikabok na ito ay tinatawag na Reflector at ginamit sa alchemy ng mga kaluluwa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:14.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Talagang kamangha-mangha ang kapangyarihan ng reflector
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.91,0:02:19.79,italics,,0,0,0,,Maaari mong buhayin ang isang patay sa pamamagitan ng pagtawag sa kanyang kaluluwa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:23.30,italics,,0,0,0,,Maaari tayong makipagpalitan ng katawan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.17,0:02:27.26,italics,,0,0,0,,Maaari mo pang paalisin ang kaluluwa sa katawan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:29.85,italics,,0,0,0,,at makuha ang kanyang enerhiya
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.23,0:02:41.02,italics,,0,0,0,,Bilang resulta, ang walang limitasyong kapangyarihang ito ay lumikha ng kaguluhan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.99,0:02:54.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Naging madugong gulo ang bansa dahil sa mga salamangkero,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:59.79,italics,,0,0,0,,na nagpakawala ng masaker para sa reflector
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:11.60,italics,,0,0,0,,Ang taong nagpatigil sa kaguluhang ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:17.31,italics,,0,0,0,, was master So Kyung, founder of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:28.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Nag-aaral ako sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:31.62,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakakamangha ang yelong bato
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:34.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Nasaan siya ngayon? gusto kong makita
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:37.29,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang nakakatakot na bato
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:39.08,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang mahika ng batong ito
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:42.79,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,lumikha ng mga kakila-kilabot na bagay na makakasakit sa mga tao
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.63,0:03:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Baby, saan mo nakita ang manika na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa kabundukan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:54.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Ipagpapalit mo ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:55.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:07.15,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang sinumpaang relic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.58,general text,,0,0,0,,- Ano iyon?\N- Ano iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:20.71,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mapanganib na item na nilikha ng mahika
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:23.04,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Alam ko kung ano ito. Mga labi
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.25,0:04:25.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Puno sila ni Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.17,0:04:28.38,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:31.30,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maraming mas mapanganib na mga bagay sa Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:34.97,italics,,0,0,0,,Maraming kakaibang bagay doon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:37.35,italics,,0,0,0,,ginawa ng kapangyarihan ng yelong bato
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:48.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Naghihintay sila ng pagkakataong makalabas muli sa liwanag
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.25,0:05:03.79,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang dalhin ko ito sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:05.75,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,Ayoko
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.96,0:05:09.67,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Let me be Won Mu Deok, na iniiwasan ng lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:13.13,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,pero hindi ko pinaglilingkuran ang lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:15.39,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Dapat siya ay nagpapasalamat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.97,0:05:21.60,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang cinnamon at ginger wine na ito ay may napakalakas na aroma ng cinnamon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:23.94,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,Salamat, Kamahalan
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.98,0:05:28.61,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Amoy cinnamon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:33.53,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Napakabastos
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.61,0:05:35.11,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May bumabagabag ba sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:37.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Kumbaga, nadumihan ako kay Won Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:40.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi nawawala ang baho
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.41,0:05:42.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mabango
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:47.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan. Pumunta ka
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:49.84,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Umalis ka na
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:51.42,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo, Kamahalan
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.85,0:06:01.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Naawa ako, iniligtas ko siya sa gulo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:04.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Binigyan siya ng sachet at silk dress
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:14.07,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Napakawalang utang na loob
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:21.74,general text,,0,0,0,,- Nagpapasalamat ako\N- Sabi ko umalis ka na...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:29.75,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Stink Mu Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Paano ka nakarating dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:35.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Akin na ang sachet mo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.93,0:06:40.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako dahil may kailangan ka ulit sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:42.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Iniisip ko ang tungkol sa akin, Kamahalan,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.10,general text,,0,0,0,,kaya ako pumunta
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:46.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi mo bang nababasa mo ang isip ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:50.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mahusay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:56.49,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Uminom ng cinnamon at ginger wine. Ang aroma ay mas malakas kaysa sa huling pagkakataon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:07.54,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mabango
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:10.42,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:18.47,general text,,0,0,0,,I have to say, I like this place
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:23.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Sana ay patuloy mo akong isipin tulad ng ginagawa mo ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.14,general text,,0,0,0,,pupunta ako sa iyo tuwing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:40.24,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang palasyo ay isang magandang lugar
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nagsusuot ka ng sutla,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:50.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,pag-inom ng mabangong alak
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:54.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba kung bakit kita naisip?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:00.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Dahil ikaw si Won Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.18,0:08:05.26,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Pero ngayon hindi ka na amoy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:08.68,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:09.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Sino ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:20.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Nahuli mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.21,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Sumakay dito ang kontrabida
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:37.75,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Hanapin lahat\N{\i1}- Oo, Kamahalan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:44.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Pero bakit sa pagkukunwari ni Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.06,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Tingnan ang bawat sulok
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:55.44,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Oo\N- Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.24,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Narito ang Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:03.28,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Prinsipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:11.96,general text,,0,0,0,,May hinahanap ako
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Sabi nila sa akin hahanapin ko ito dito
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:18.46,general text,,0,0,0,,May nangyari ba? Mukhang nag-aalala
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:22.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Nagkaroon ng problema ang kasambahay at nawala, hinahanap namin siya
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:23.38,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Lingkod?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.47,0:09:25.22,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya gumagana para sa amin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:27.47,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mu Doc. Kasambahay ng pamilya Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.55,0:09:29.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang hinahanap ko
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:31.72,general text,,0,0,0,,May nangyari ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.48,0:09:34.48,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Itong kasambahay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.90,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, aksidenteng nabasag ang yin-yang jade na nilayon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:40.82,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,para sa mga singsing sa kasal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.74,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko mag-ingat ka
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.16,memories,,0,0,0,,Ano na ang gagawin mo ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:51.08,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin, madam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:52.95,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Patawarin mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.29,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,tatawagan ko dito ang may-ari nito
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:57.46,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,I-lock siya sa annex
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.63,0:10:01.59,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.46,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.76,italics,,0,0,0,,Marahil takot sa parusa
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:09.05,italics,,0,0,0,,Habang nakakulong siya, nagnakaw siya ng jade at tumakbo palayo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:15.35,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dahil hindi pa namin siya nahahanap,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:18.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ay umalis na siya sa lugar na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:21.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Natakot at tumakas?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.61,0:10:24.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Ganyan katapang na babae?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:28.74,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dumating na ang mga Mage ng Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:40.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, ano ang nagdadala sa iyo dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.25,0:10:41.84,general text,,0,0,0,,At ikaw, Yul?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.42,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Naghahanap ng isang tao
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Naghahanap ka rin ba ng Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.68,0:10:48.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.76,0:10:50.97,general text,,0,0,0,,dumating ako dahil sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:11:01.19,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nabasag niya ang jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:03.57,general text,,0,0,0,,at tumakas para hindi maparusahan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:07.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi ka gumawa ng ring noong araw na iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:12.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako sa Chwisongru para "ipahiram" ang aking kamay, ngunit sinabi nila sa akin na umalis ka
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.16,0:11:16.45,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Napagpasyahan kong gawin ang mga ito sa ibang pagkakataon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:20.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, bakit mo hinahanap si Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:24.88,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko ang kapareho mong pangitain, Kamahalan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Paano ka nakarating dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.95,0:11:51.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako dahil na-miss mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:55.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig sabihin nito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Na-miss mo yung nakilala mo sa Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.08,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Tigilan mo ako sa pagloloko
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Na-miss ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:05.00,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Wala sa uri\N- {\i1}Mali
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:06.92,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Pumito ka
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:13.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka naabala ng baling binti
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:16.85,general text,,0,0,0,,At hindi ka natakot na pagalitan ka nila
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.06,0:12:20.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Dahil nagustuhan mo siya
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:28.78,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Patuloy na isipin ang tungkol sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.74,0:12:38.12,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay muli akong lalapit sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.08,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ikaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:46.96,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,hindi tao
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.10,0:12:59.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Tatanggalin mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.23,0:13:03.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Then hindi na tayo magkikita
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.47,0:13:36.39,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya. Isang pangitain lang
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.64,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,So ito ay isang pangitain?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:43.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Kakaiba, kaya pumunta ako sa Jwiseonru para hanapin si Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:45.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinabi sa akin na kinaladkad siya dito
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi nila siya kinaladkad. May pasok siya
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.90,0:13:52.53,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At nawala siya na may kasamang mahalagang relic
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:56.11,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Magnanakaw ang hanap namin, hindi pangitain
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:02.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At narito ang kanyang may-ari
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:21.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala na si Master Li ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.85,0:14:24.14,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang lalaking ito ay parang hangin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:26.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Iniwan niya sa akin ang aso at umalis
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:30.06,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nilikha din ba si Gwigu mula sa ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:33.94,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ginawa ito ni Master So Kyung mula sa lakas ng bato,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:36.15,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,upang mahanap ang mga bakas ng pangkukulam
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:39.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Binira ni Uk ang urn ni Gwiga,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:42.99,general text,,0,0,0,,kaya ibinalik ni Master Lee ang kanyang kaluluwa mula kay Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:45.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at ilagay ito sa asong ito
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.41,0:14:48.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo talaga alam kung nasaan si Master Seo Kyung
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.88,0:14:51.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, tinatakan ang bato?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:53.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.96,0:14:57.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo ba ay muling kumalat ang alchemy ng mga kaluluwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.09,general text,,0,0,0,,dahil may nakakita ng bato?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.64,0:15:04.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang tanging paraan upang malipat ang isang kaluluwa nang hindi pinagkadalubhasaan ang Hwangsu ay
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.23,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,gumamit ng bato
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:10.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong may nag-print nito
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:12.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at pagbabalik sa liwanag
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:16.07,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Buweno, hindi ito maganda
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:20.28,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang kakila-kilabot na 200 taon na ang nakalilipas ay hindi na papayagang mangyari muli
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:24.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kailangan nating maghanap ng batong yelo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:37.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Inutusan akong ibigay ito sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.39,0:15:50.14,italics,,0,0,0,,Akala ko magtatago ka muna sa ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:53.61,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maaari mo bang tulungan ang ibang tao na mag-migrate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:59.36,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Sabihin sa akin na natanggap ko ang parsela
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.45,0:16:01.49,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:10.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Bilisan mo at humanap ako ng eunuch na papalit sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.04,0:16:16.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang iyong kaluluwa ay lilipat sa kanyang katawan, pumili nang matalino
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.09,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:21.18,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Silbihan ko si Dan Zhu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.26,0:16:23.26,offscreen,,0,0,0,,hindi para lumipat sa katawan ng isang eunuch
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:27.35,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Gumagamit ako ng Nak Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:29.77,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,para makuha ang gusto kong katawan
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:41.20,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Nakakatakot ang ginawa ng kasambahay ko
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.70,0:16:43.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bilang may-ari niya, papasanin ko ang buong responsibilidad
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:46.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:53.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Malamang nagalit ka na nasira ang jade para sa mga singsing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:56.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakiusap ako sa nanay ko para sa jade na ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:16:59.59,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,dahil gawa dito ang mga singsing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:01.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,gawing mahaba at masaya ang kasal
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngunit ito ay sira
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.26,0:17:06.43,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam na may malalim itong kahulugan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:08.89,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Dapat kong sabihin na ako rin ay masama ang loob
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.39,0:17:14.48,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maghahanap tayo ng mas angkop na jade para sa mga singsing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.23,0:17:19.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Tinatanggap ko ang iyong paghingi ng tawad
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- You can go\N- Salamat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:23.65,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kaya
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dapat kong mahanap si Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:32.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong hanapin itong masamang dalaga,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:35.12,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,upang ibalik niya ang yin-yang jade
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:39.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Mahina siya, maikli ang kanyang mga binti, hindi siya makalayo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:44.34,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Payagan akong ako mismo ang maghanap nito
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:50.31,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pinapayagan ko
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.22,0:17:52.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Salamat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:56.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Ngayon gusto kong buksan mo ang pinto
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:00.15,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Door to Jinyeowon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:02.99,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kung saan iniimbak ang mga labi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:26.09,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,, Tanging miyembro ng pamilya Jin ang makakapagbukas ng pintong ito
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:30.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Ngayon kami lang ni Cho Young ang may kakayahan nito
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.93,0:18:33.06,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya maaaring naroroon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:34.64,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakakita ako ng isang pangitain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:39.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Baka nanaginip ka
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.81,0:18:42.98,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bakit sigurado ka na ang pangitain ay nilikha ng isang relic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:44.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko rin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.78,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Vision sa imahe ni Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.74,0:18:53.12,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Lahat ng relics na maaaring gawin ng mga pangitain ay nasa Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:54.50,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Suriin natin
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:57.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, bubuksan ko na ang pinto
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:03.25,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang lugar na ito ay puno ng mga mapanganib na labi
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:06.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maaaring angkinin ka ng kasamaan upang hindi ka na makabalik
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:10.64,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mr, ito ay masyadong mapanganib
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:13.51,italics,,0,0,0,,Sasamahan ko siya
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.27,0:19:18.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Pupunta rin ako
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:24.32,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Masaya
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:27.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Kailan ka pa magkakaroon ng pagkakataon na makarating sa Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Enter
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.81,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mayroon kang isang oras
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:11.95,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dapat kong sabihin sa ulo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.12,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:19.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:26.88,general text,,0,0,0,,So ito si Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:31.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Mahal daw lahat dito. Walang halaga ng pera ang makakabili sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:34.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Pwede bang tumahimik ka? Wala kaming lakad
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.43,0:20:36.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ba ang may-ari?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.56,0:20:40.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Bagaman, ganito ang mangyayari kung pakakasalan mo si Jin Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:43.65,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maswerte
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.73,0:20:46.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang lahat ng mga alahas na ito ay magiging iyo, Jin Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:50.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung inggit ka sa akin, pwede mo siyang pakasalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:54.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Ngunit kahit na maging may-ari, paano mo makokontrol ang lahat ng ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:56.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mababang salamangkero
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.41,0:20:58.74,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Kung sobrang cool mo, pwede ka bang humipo dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:02.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinabi ni Chief Jinyeowon na huwag hawakan ang anumang bagay dito
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.71,0:21:05.71,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pagbibigay-katwiran. Natatakot ka lang
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:13.05,general text,,0,0,0,,- Iyon lang\N- Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:14.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam. Ano iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:17.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.18,0:21:19.60,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May kakaiba dito
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:22.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba natatakot?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.44,0:21:24.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Natatakot
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:27.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Ang dilim dito, mag-ingat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Natakot ba talaga siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:34.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo. Kapag natakot si Yul, ginulo niya ang direksyon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.95,0:21:36.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, maling paraan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:38.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa ganitong paraan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:41.62,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ayan, oo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:47.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Mag-ingat tayong lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:52.17,italics,,0,0,0,,Kalmado palagi si Yul,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:55.34,italics,,0,0,0,,at sobrang absent-minded kapag natatakot siya
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:21:57.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Isang bagay na katulad nito
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.68,0:22:04.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Kaya mag-ingat tayo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:06.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maging iyong sarili
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.19,0:22:09.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Sabay na tayo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.73,0:22:48.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Paano ako na-lock dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:01.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kinailangan kong pigilan ang aking sarili
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.37,0:23:05.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi na kailangang pukawin siya
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.33,0:23:08.87,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Sinabihan kang mag-ingat
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:12.00,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Maghintay dito. Malapit nang dumating ang iyong amo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.59,0:23:15.21,memories,,0,0,0,,Madam, ano na ang mangyayari sa akin ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.30,0:23:18.38,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ano pa? Paparusahan ka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.18,0:23:21.43,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Hindi iyon ang inaalala ko
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.51,0:23:24.22,memories,,0,0,0,,Sabi nila kapag nabasag mo ang yin-yang jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.31,0:23:27.06,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,hindi ka magiging masaya sa pagsasama
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:30.94,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ano ang dapat kong gawin ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.11,0:23:33.98,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig sabihin nito?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:35.40,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Huwag magsalita ng walang kapararakan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.53,0:23:38.28,memories,,0,0,0,,Sabi nila kung masira mo itong jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:41.41,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,hindi ka mamahalin pabalik ng taong mahal mo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.03,0:23:44.91,memories,,0,0,0,,Sinabi ng lahat ng gisaeng sa Jwiseonru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.99,0:23:47.50,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Totoo ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.58,0:23:48.71,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.37,0:23:53.17,memories,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo alam madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.79,0:23:55.34,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito maaaring
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:23:59.51,memories,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon ano ang mangyayari sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.22,0:24:04.89,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nag-aalala,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.60,0:24:07.35,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,kung sinira ko ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.81,0:24:13.77,memories,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang nakabasag nito diba?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.69,0:24:17.78,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Pinabuhat nila ako sa kanya para sisihin siya dito
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.65,0:24:19.61,memories,,0,0,0,,Tama ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.86,0:24:24.45,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Kaawa-awa. Dapat may sinabi ako kahit papano sa nanay ko noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.12,0:24:27.41,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Kung ipinahiya ko ang kanyang anak sa harap ng lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.20,0:24:30.37,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,hindi niya ako mapapatawad
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.96,0:24:32.25,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako natatakot sayo,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.92,0:24:36.46,memories,,0,0,0,,pero natatakot ako sa nanay mo, ang ulo ni Jinyoung
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.76,0:24:41.26,memories,,0,0,0,,Takot na takot ka ba sa nanay mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.84,0:24:44.76,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Maaaring takot ako kay nanay, pero galit ako sayo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.89,0:24:46.93,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ibebenta kita
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.81,0:24:50.23,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Tulad ng sabi mo, nakakatakot ang nanay ko
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.31,0:24:53.69,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ibebenta ka para sa pagbasag ng jade
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.27,0:24:55.48,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Napakalayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.40,0:25:38.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Tumakas ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.97,0:26:12.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Siguro dapat kong subukang umakyat sa pader?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.72,0:26:52.76,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Paano niya nabuksan ang pinto ni Jinyoewon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.31,0:27:02.98,voiceover,,0,0,0,,So ito si Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.57,0:27:10.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung ikulong mo siya sa loob, baka mamatay siya
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.93,0:27:38.06,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.36,0:27:46.82,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya ikaw
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.03,0:27:52.53,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Matagal nang hindi nagkita
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.02,0:28:21.19,italics,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka makakaalis
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.19,0:28:24.44,italics,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito masisira
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.27,0:28:27.61,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito gagana!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.82,0:28:32.99,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Shut up
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.42,0:28:46.92,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Namatay ba talaga siya dahil wala siyang magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.09,0:28:49.97,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Paano kung isa lang siyang vision...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.05,0:28:55.14,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.39,0:29:00.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Naririnig ko ang tunog ng iyong bawat galaw
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.19,0:29:03.31,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tunog nito,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:06.06,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,parang dalawang jade na naghahampas sa isa't isa
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.25,0:29:21.08,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.55,0:29:31.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Isang oras na ang lumipas, kailangan na nating umalis
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.72,0:29:34.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pupuntahan, kailangan ko siyang hanapin
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.09,0:29:37.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Masyadong malaki ang lugar na ito, hindi namin siya mahahanap na tatlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.55,0:29:40.81,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ka pa rin dito para tumingin sa paligid, para makapunta ka
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.68,0:29:44.48,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kailan dumating sa iyo ang pangitain ni Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.52,0:29:47.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung paano siya nagpakita
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.81,0:29:49.02,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:54.45,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,dumating ako dahil na-miss mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.53,0:29:55.61,italics,,0,0,0,,Eksakto
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.70,0:29:56.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinabi niya rin sa akin iyon
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.49,0:29:58.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Na dumating siya dahil iniisip ko siya
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:02.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya ang kanyang paningin ay nanggagaling sa pag-iisip tungkol sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.58,0:30:04.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Kaya hindi mo siya nakita
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.50,0:30:07.08,italics,,0,0,0,,Lumapit siya sa akin at kay Yulia,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.17,0:30:09.75,general text,,0,0,0,,pero hindi sa iyo, bagama't ikaw ang may-ari nito
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.84,0:30:12.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo naisip si Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.51,0:30:18.68,general text,,0,0,0,,uminom ako ng cinnamon at ginger wine
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.76,0:30:21.77,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Nalasing mo ba siya nang labis na naamoy niya ang cinnamon isang metro ang layo?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.85,0:30:22.81,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.81,0:30:25.77,general text,,0,0,0,, binigyan ko siya ng isa pang sasha noong araw na iyon
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.85,0:30:28.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Sa kanya siguro nanggaling ang amoy ng cinnamon
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.69,0:30:30.94,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oh, pinag-uusapan mo ang sachet na iyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.73,0:30:34.40,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,na isinabit niya malapit sa palikuran para makaiwas sa mga langaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.07,0:30:36.49,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Malapit sa banyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.57,0:30:39.87,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Salamat, Kamahalan. Napakahusay nitong iniiwasan ang mga langaw
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.79,0:30:44.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, ano ang ginagawa mo nang dumating sa iyo ang pangitain?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.25,0:30:48.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Salamin
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.63,0:30:52.09,general text,,0,0,0,,- Nabasag ang salamin ko\N- Akin din
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:56.76,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay lumilitaw mula sa salamin?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.09,0:31:00.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Salamin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.64,0:31:06.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Ito ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.03,0:31:20.16,italics,,0,0,0,,Hindi ikaw yan, peke yan
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.24,0:31:21.45,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Vision
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.42,0:31:31.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya ikaw
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.92,0:31:39.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Naka-lock ba siya sa salamin?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.68,0:31:41.80,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.89,0:31:44.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi namin makita kung ano ang nasa loob, pero sigurado kaming nandoon siya
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:46.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Napalunok siya ng salamin ni Tosca
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.02,0:31:49.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Salamin ng Pangungulila?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.35,0:31:51.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang relic na ito ay lumilikha ng mga pangitain
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.36,0:31:53.69,italics,,0,0,0,,gamit ang iba pang salamin,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.77,0:31:56.36,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,upang ipakita kung ano ang gustong makita ng isang tao
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.65,0:32:00.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala siyang magic, kaya tiyak na naubos siya nito,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.28,0:32:01.66,general text,,0,0,0,,nang tingnan niya ito
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.37,0:32:05.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kailangan nating kunin si Moo Dok mula sa salamin
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.79,0:32:09.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi gagana ang mga spells namin dahil masyadong malakas ang energy sa loob
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.67,0:32:12.46,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pakilabas ang salamin ni Tosca sa Jinewon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.50,0:32:14.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Imposible ito
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.00,0:32:17.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Nilulon ng relic ang isang lalaki
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.05,0:32:20.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Masyadong delikado na alisin ang salamin doon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:23.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, inuutusan kita bilang Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.35,0:32:24.47,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kunin ang salamin sa labas
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.93,0:32:30.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Binigyan kami ng Unified Council ng anting-anting para protektahan si Jinyowon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.81,0:32:32.94,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, eksakto sa mga ganitong sitwasyon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.86,0:32:39.15,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko ito matiis kahit na sa utos ng hari
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.99,0:32:43.49,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi gagana ang UK
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.66,0:32:45.95,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,walang Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.03,0:32:48.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay kailangan niyang manatili sa loob
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.33,0:32:51.71,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kapag tapos na ang oras,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.79,0:32:53.67,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Itatatakan ko ang pinto
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.80,0:32:57.71,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ina
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.59,0:33:00.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakahanap ako ng yin-yang jade
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.43,0:33:05.97,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito ninakaw ni Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.01,0:33:08.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Nahanap ko na,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.64,0:33:11.14,italics,,0,0,0,,kaya ilabas mo ang salamin ng Melancholy at iligtas si Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.23,0:33:13.94,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Mamamatay si Chan Wook kapag naka-lock siya sa loob
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.73,0:33:15.81,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Huwag makialam
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.77,0:33:20.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa sandaling matapos ang ipinangakong oras, tatatakan ko ang pinto
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.58,0:33:38.09,italics,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-aksaya ng enerhiya
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.17,0:33:40.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Alam mong hindi mo ito masisira
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.34,0:33:42.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Isa ka lang pangitain
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.34,0:33:44.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo, ako ay isang pangitain
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.09,0:33:47.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang pangitain na nagpapakita ng totoong ikaw
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.52,0:33:55.31,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi maaaring tingnan ng mga tao ang kanilang sarili mula sa labas
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.40,0:33:57.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Salamin lang ang makakatulong sa kanila dito
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.94,0:34:01.44,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Samakatuwid, ang iyong ideya sa iyong sarili
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.57,0:34:04.24,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,isang pangitain lang
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.95,0:34:10.99,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ganito kung paano ka nakikita ng iba
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.87,0:34:15.87,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakikita lamang nila kung ano ang gusto nila, at sila mismo ang lumikha ng imahe na kailangan nila
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.54,0:34:19.88,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isa ring pangitain
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.55,0:34:21.92,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung nagsasabi ka ng totoo,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.09,0:34:25.59,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na ang ibig sabihin ay mga pangitain lamang ang nakikita ng mga tao at wala nang iba pa
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.84,0:34:27.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Eksakto
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.68,0:34:31.72,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,I turn into what they want to see most and show them it
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.06,0:34:37.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko rin para sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.15,0:34:46.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bigyan mo ako ng iyong lakas
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.78,0:34:47.82,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ko
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.03,0:34:51.41,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,I will turn into the most ideal version of you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.04,0:34:58.21,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.71,0:35:02.71,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kailangan mo ang aking pagmuni-muni upang lumikha ng ganoong pangitain
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.96,0:35:05.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.72,0:35:07.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung walang dapat ilarawan,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.39,0:35:10.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, ang salamin ay mawawalan ng silbi
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.28,0:35:33.83,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Isang baso ka lang
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.58,0:35:37.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sapat na usapan
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.33,0:35:39.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.75,0:35:42.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Nandiyan ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:45.13,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.71,0:35:47.88,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.64,0:35:51.68,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.56,0:35:55.31,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, nandito ako
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.52,0:35:58.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Natagpuan
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.19,0:36:07.82,italics,,0,0,0,,Tapos na ang oras
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.49,0:36:10.66,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Cho Young, isara ang pinto
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:11.82,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ina
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.82,0:36:15.41,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Ngayon{\i1}\N- Mangyaring maghintay
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.30,0:36:28.88,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong mag-log in
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.34,0:36:32.30,italics,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi madala sa labas ang relic,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.39,0:36:36.76,general text,,0,0,0,,tapos ako mismo ang papasok doon at hihilahin siya palabas ng salamin
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.85,0:36:39.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Paano ko papayagan ang isang makapangyarihang mago na pumasok?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.02,0:36:41.31,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Magtiwala ka sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.10,0:36:44.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako maglalagay ng daliri sa isang artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.77,0:36:46.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko rin alam
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.23,0:36:49.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Binago na ng magician mula sa Sosnovy Bor ang tiwala ko
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.65,0:36:55.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Napapasok mo na ba ang magician ng Pine Forest sa Jinyeowon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.99,0:36:59.70,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Kung gusto mong iligtas si Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.79,0:37:03.54,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kailangan mong hilingin sa mga salamangkero ng Jeonjingak na paalisin siya doon
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.71,0:37:08.76,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kabanata,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.84,0:37:10.01,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,wala tayong masyadong oras
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.55,0:37:15.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul, gusto kong pumasok ka
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.68,0:37:18.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at inilabas si Uka mula doon
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.81,0:37:24.94,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.02,0:37:27.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Habang wala ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.61,0:37:30.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Iniisip ko
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.95,0:37:33.24,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ano ang magagawa ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.57,0:37:36.66,italics,,0,0,0,,para maging malapit ka
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.95,0:37:41.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung ako ay magiging gwangju ni Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.75,0:37:45.42,general text,,0,0,0,,pwede kang maging deputy ko
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.33,0:37:48.00,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bakit kailangan ko ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.09,0:37:50.76,italics,,0,0,0,,Sabi mo ayaw mong manatiling maid ko
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.84,0:37:53.68,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi namin masasabi kahit kanino na ikaw ang aking guro
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.76,0:37:56.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Pero maaari kang manatili kung magiging katulong kita
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.39,0:37:59.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Magtatago ba si Gwangju Jeongbugwan ng nomad sa tabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.47,0:38:02.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Nababaliw ka na ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.90,0:38:08.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Naisip ko ito nang marinig ko ang balita tungkol sa kasal ko
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.27,0:38:11.23,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,"Sa wakas ay mayroon na siyang rutang pagtakas"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.32,0:38:14.07,general text,,0,0,0,,"Paano ako mabubuhay kung wala siya?"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.82,0:38:17.74,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong nawalan ka ng gana
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.71,0:38:25.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kapag wala ka, hindi rin ako
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.67,0:38:28.96,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,pakiramdam na nawawala
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.89,0:38:45.06,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.15,0:38:48.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss na kita
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.43,0:39:24.18,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Kung mahuli nila ako, kunwari wala kang alam
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.02,0:39:27.85,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Walang sinuman dito ang papayag na atakihin ako ng halimaw na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.19,0:39:35.90,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Then help me
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.99,0:39:37.86,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,umakyat doon
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.53,0:39:39.36,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.45,0:39:42.91,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Dadalhin kita sa tuktok ng punong ito
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.78,0:40:16.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.19,0:40:18.19,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyayari?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.49,0:40:21.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Nandito siya
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.74,0:40:22.95,italics,,0,0,0,,Sino?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.53,0:40:25.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Siya ito, ang babaeng bulag!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.33,0:40:27.70,italics,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang batong yelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.00,0:40:33.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Masisira ang salamin
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.21,0:40:35.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Lumayo
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.86,0:41:39.90,italics,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.40,0:41:41.65,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.74,0:41:44.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- Ayos ka lang ba?\N- Maayos ang lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.16,0:41:46.07,general text,,0,0,0,,- Ligtas ba si Mu Dok?\N- Syempre
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.31,0:42:17.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Nabadtrip ako habang bitbit ang yin-yang jade
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.02,0:42:21.36,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ito ay nasira noon
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.65,0:42:25.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Kaya sinubukan mong sisihin ang kasambahay para sa nabasag na jade
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.32,0:42:28.57,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At ang salamin ng Tosca?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.78,0:42:31.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakatayo ito sa malapit,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.79,0:42:33.50,general text,,0,0,0,,pero hindi ko man lang hinawakan
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.12,0:42:37.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi sapat ang lakas ng UK para masira ito
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.08,0:42:39.54,italics,,0,0,0,,Kung ganoon ay dapat,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.63,0:42:42.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Nasira ko ang salamin noong taglagas
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.93,0:42:48.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,A Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.05,0:42:51.97,general text,,0,0,0,,nagkulong ka rin ba sa Jinewon?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.06,0:42:55.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Ako ang nag-seal ng pinto, pero mag-isa siyang pumasok sa loob.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.77,0:42:59.52,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Tanging mga miyembro ng pamilyang Jin ang maaaring magbukas ng mga pintuan ng Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.19,0:43:02.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi mo bang nabuksan sila ni Moo Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.78,0:43:06.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon, marahil,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.15,0:43:08.78,general text,,0,0,0,,binuksan ko sila
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.57,0:43:12.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko na lang siyang pumasok doon at galit na isinara ang pinto.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.12,0:43:16.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.71,0:43:19.08,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sasabihin ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.67,0:43:23.59,general text,,0,0,0,,para walang magsalita tungkol sa nangyari
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.13,0:43:29.14,general text,,0,0,0,,wala rin akong sasabihin,\Npara hindi masira ang reputasyon mo
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.39,0:43:32.14,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Taos-puso kong paghingi ng tawad
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.06,0:43:37.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.06,0:43:39.40,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Wala ka pa ring nakikita?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.23,0:43:42.15,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.73,0:43:44.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Nang nabasag ang salamin, napakaliwanag ng ilaw
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.61,0:43:47.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko maimulat ang aking mga mata
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.45,0:43:52.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kailangan naming takpan ang iyong mga mata
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.00,0:43:57.12,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dito
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.54,0:44:05.34,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung titingnan mo ang araw nang matagal, maaaring mawala ang iyong paningin saglit
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.09,0:44:07.30,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Gagaling ka sa lalong madaling panahon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.05,0:44:10.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Patawarin mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.14,0:44:12.60,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo kasalanan
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.39,0:44:14.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Kasalanan lahat ni Mrs. Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.65,0:44:27.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.32,0:44:30.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo dito, Mr. Dan Gu?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.57,0:44:33.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Nag-alala ako
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.62,0:44:35.99,italics,,0,0,0,,Sakit ang mata ko
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.58,0:44:38.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yul, dumating ka rin ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.71,0:44:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mo silang suriin ka sa Sejukwon, dadalhin kita doon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.92,0:44:47.84,italics,,0,0,0,,Hindi naman kalayuan ang palasyo, pwede siyang pumunta doon
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.34,0:44:50.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, nandito ka rin ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.10,0:44:57.85,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ibibigay ko sa iyo ang mga manggagamot ng hari
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.47,0:44:59.85,italics,,0,0,0,,Walang kailangan
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.93,0:45:03.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Nabulag siya sa liwanag, hindi nasira ang kanyang mga mata
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.23,0:45:07.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Alam kong hindi mo kasalanan,\Npero pumunta sila dito dahil sayo
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.44,0:45:10.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Kaya humingi ng paumanhin at salamat sa lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.20,0:45:14.66,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin sa abala sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.32,0:45:16.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maraming salamat
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.30,0:45:30.42,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Guro...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.01,0:45:33.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Uwi na tayo
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.24,0:45:59.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ng nangyari
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.41,0:46:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung ano ang mangyayari sa kasal
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.29,0:46:04.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Narinig mo ba ang sinabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.50,0:46:08.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Handa siyang isara ang pinto, sa kabila ng katotohanang nasa loob ang master.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.13,0:46:10.25,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakakatakot
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.34,0:46:13.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala na magkakaroon siya ng ganyang biyenan
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.42,0:46:15.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Ginawa niya ito para protektahan si Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.26,0:46:18.26,italics,,0,0,0,,Kapag may pinoprotektahan ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.35,0:46:21.47,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,minsan kailangan mong gumawa ng mahihirap na desisyon
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.14,0:46:23.31,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.31,0:46:25.94,general text,,0,0,0,,gawin mo rin ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.35,0:46:30.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Naglakas-loob akong sabihin na ikaw at ako ay malapit
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.32,0:46:33.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung nasa loob ako? Isasara mo ba ang pinto?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.61,0:46:35.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Napakawalang awa?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.16,0:46:41.29,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Talaga...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.16,0:46:43.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mukhang gagawin mo ito
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.75,0:46:46.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Kahit buhay ko ang nakataya?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.96,0:46:49.42,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Huwag mo akong ilagay sa mahirap na posisyon
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.63,0:46:52.25,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,dahil sa isang kathang-isip na kaganapan
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.34,0:46:54.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi talaga ako naka-lock
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.92,0:46:57.30,italics,,0,0,0,,Mahirap magsinungaling at magsabi,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.38,0:46:59.60,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,- na hinding-hindi mo tatatakan ang pinto?{\i1}\N- Hindi ko kaya
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.10,0:47:03.64,general text,,0,0,0,,lie to you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.60,0:47:06.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Eksakto
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.81,0:47:09.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Ito ang dapat mong gawin
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.36,0:47:16.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Dapat kamustahin mo si Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.11,0:47:20.91,general text,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it, wala akong masabi sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.12,0:47:24.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I can't act like everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.08,0:47:28.17,general text,,0,0,0,,I see. Salamat sa lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.75,0:47:29.58,italics,,0,0,0,,Panahon na para sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.09,0:47:40.34,general text,,0,0,0,,But still, maid Kim,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.72,0:47:44.31,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kung kailangan kong isara ang pinto,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.81,0:47:47.43,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na madudurog ang puso ko
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.15,0:47:51.52,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,sa mga piraso
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.15,0:48:01.95,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Inflexible at slow-witted
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.16,0:48:06.79,general text,,0,0,0,,"Paano ko maitatatak ang pinto kung nasa loob ka?"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.25,0:48:10.37,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba pwedeng sabihin lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.68,0:48:26.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay mapanganib
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.68,0:48:30.44,italics,,0,0,0,,Ipasok ang Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.52,0:48:33.11,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ay isang walang pag-iisip na gawaing pambata
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.19,0:48:34.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Huwag masyadong magalit
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.36,0:48:38.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Baka akalain mong nakakaawa ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.45,0:48:40.57,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ngunit ito ay iyong pananaw lamang
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.62,0:48:43.45,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.53,0:48:45.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinabi sa akin ng salamin sa Jinyowon,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.29,0:48:48.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na nakikita lang ng mga tao kung ano
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:50.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kung ano ang gusto nila
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.46,0:48:52.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang pangitain
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.58,0:48:54.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang sabihin na para kang isang pangitain sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.84,0:48:55.92,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi ito ang kaso,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.13,0:48:59.17,general text,,0,0,0,,bakit mo ako gustong maupo?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.55,0:49:04.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Buong buhay ko ay pilit kong sinusubukan
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.26,0:49:07.64,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,patunayan sa lahat na ako ay anak ng aking ama
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.72,0:49:08.68,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngunit
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.98,0:49:11.23,general text,,0,0,0,,sabi mo hindi totoo
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.31,0:49:13.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nasaktan ako, ngunit nakatulong ito sa akin na maalis ang mga ilusyon
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.98,0:49:15.48,italics,,0,0,0,,Ngunit kahit na pagkatapos ng lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.56,0:49:17.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,bakit gusto mo akong manatiling isang pangitain?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.82,0:49:19.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam kung sino ka
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.65,0:49:22.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Isa lang ang gusto ko
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.41,0:49:24.78,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Panatilihin kang ligtas...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.28,0:49:27.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,mula sa mga panganib
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.16,0:49:35.63,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nawalan na ng kahulugan ang aking layunin
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.92,0:49:39.34,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya mula ngayon...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.84,0:49:42.34,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Susubukan ko
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.80,0:49:45.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,alamin kung sino ako
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.72,0:49:48.22,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at kung sino ang dapat maging
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.59,0:50:20.88,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngayon nakita mo na?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.76,0:50:23.76,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo. nakikita ko
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.60,0:50:29.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.60,0:50:31.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinabi sa akin na ang salamin na iyon ay naglalaro sa imahinasyon
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.97,0:50:34.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Kinailangan kong tingnan kung talagang iniligtas kita
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.19,0:50:38.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ako nailigtas. Sinira ko ito at lumabas ako
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.48,0:50:40.32,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.40,0:50:42.15,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Nang napadpad ako sa salamin,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.82,0:50:45.07,general text,,0,0,0,,sandali lang bumalik ang lakas ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.15,0:50:46.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,tulad ng sa Gyeongcheongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.91,0:50:50.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Sigurado akong nabasag ko ang salamin gamit ang sarili kong lakas
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.28,0:50:51.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Ganun ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.95,0:50:54.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Sobrang saya ko, akala ko naligtas kita
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.12,0:50:55.21,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Inilabas ang aking labi
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.29,0:50:57.92,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dapat kang magpasalamat na hindi ka sinipsip dito
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.00,0:51:01.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Nasa loob ka, iniisip ko
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.09,0:51:02.63,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Anong kalokohan
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.13,0:51:05.05,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka nito ipagpapalit sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.13,0:51:07.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Paano kung sinipsip ako nito? Kaya hindi ito kasinungalingan?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.55,0:51:08.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Well, sana nakaligtas ako
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.01,0:51:10.35,general text,,0,0,0,,At mamamatay ako!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.10,0:51:15.10,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Makinig, mag-aaral. Kapag ang sitwasyon ay walang pag-asa,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.18,0:51:18.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ang pinakamagandang solusyon ay isakripisyo ang iyong sarili at iligtas ako
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.48,0:51:19.81,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Oo, ngayon din!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.27,0:51:22.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung mamatay ako, dapat ikaw din
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.73,0:51:24.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka mabubuhay nang kumportable kung wala ako
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.07,0:51:27.74,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At wala nang iba pa!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.82,0:51:31.03,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung ilalagay mo sa panganib ang buhay ng isang estudyante, dapat mong ipagsapalaran ang iyong sariling buhay
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.95,0:51:34.04,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Okay. Itatago ko ito sa isip para sa hinaharap
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.91,0:51:36.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Ano ang gagawin mo sa pagpapakasal sa isang babae,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.91,0:51:39.63,general text,,0,0,0,,sino halos pumatay sa teacher mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.67,0:51:44.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang pagpapakasal sa kanya ay isang garantiya ng aking kaligtasan
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.80,0:51:48.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Pero muntik ka ng mawala sa buhay mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.38,0:51:51.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kaya kailangan ko ring ipagsapalaran ang akin
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.64,0:51:59.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang kasal ng kaginhawahan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.19,0:52:03.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Aming lutasin ang lahat ng hindi pagkakaunawaan pagkatapos ng kasal
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.32,0:52:05.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Itinuring mo akong manugang,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.65,0:52:08.28,general text,,0,0,0,,dahil ako ang tagapagmana ng pamilya Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.36,0:52:10.36,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at posibleng kandidato para sa post ni Gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.24,0:52:13.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Magkakaisa ang ating mga pamilya at magiging mas maimpluwensyahan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.33,0:52:17.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dahil ito ay isang kasal ng kaginhawahan,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.16,0:52:20.62,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,dapat nating hayagang pag-usapan ang ating mga kalakasan at kahinaan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.42,0:52:23.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Malamang hindi ako anak ni Gwangju Chang Gang
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.80,0:52:28.80,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang mga ganitong tsismis ay hindi nakakaabala sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.26,0:52:33.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Pero paano kung ang mga tsismis na ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.30,0:52:35.35,general text,,0,0,0,,talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.27,0:52:40.19,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Handa ka na bang makipagsapalaran...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.94,0:52:43.81,general text,,0,0,0,,at tanggapin mo ako bilang manugang mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.03,0:52:58.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I see you are still wearing the bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.46,0:53:02.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.54,0:53:07.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman walang pakundangan
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.89,0:53:20.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo naisipang pakasalan si Cho Young nang hindi ito pinag-uusapan sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.85,0:53:25.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Sino ka para makialam sa mga gawain ng pamilya natin?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.31,0:53:26.44,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ate,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.36,0:53:30.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Miyembro din ako ng pamilya Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.82,0:53:36.45,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang apelyido na Jin ay ibinibigay lamang sa mga taong ang mga ina ay mula sa angkan ng Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.70,0:53:41.41,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang aking ina ay tanga, nagbibigay ng apelyido na iyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.08,0:53:44.25,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na ipinaglihi ng ating ama sa labas ng kasal
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.96,0:53:47.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Tatanggalin mo na ako sa sandaling maging pinuno ka ng Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.13,0:53:51.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Galit ka pa rin sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.59,0:53:52.72,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito isang bagay ng pagkakasala
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.84,0:53:55.39,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, hinamak kita
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.35,0:54:01.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Isa kang taksil, dahil dito hinahamak kita
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.94,0:54:08.11,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang pinuno ng Jinyeowon ay hindi dapat gumawa ng mga desisyon batay sa mga personal na kagustuhan
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.40,0:54:11.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Piliin mo si Chan Wook, nagkakamali ka
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.99,0:54:13.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Huwag ipakasal si Cho Young kay Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.49,0:54:14.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.41,0:54:19.24,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Alam ko ang pinakamahusay na kapareha para sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.99,0:54:21.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Gaano mo gusto ang Crown Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.20,0:54:23.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,bilang manugang?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.79,0:54:31.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang sumama ang Crown Prince sa pamilya natin at tayo ay magkakasama?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.84,0:54:33.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Si Cho Young ay ang pangalawang anak na babae ng pamilya
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.59,0:54:36.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Si Bu Young ang panganay, siya ang mamumuno sa pamilya
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.01,0:54:39.22,italics,,0,0,0,,Sasali sa pamilya ang kanyang magiging asawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.30,0:54:40.89,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,para mabuhay si Cho Young kasama ng prinsipe sa palasyo
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.43,0:54:46.60,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Anong balak mo? How dare you talk about Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.36,0:54:54.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Alam kong hinahanap pa rin ng asawa mo si Boo Young
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.53,0:54:58.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bilang kinatawan ng Gwangju Jeonbugwan,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.28,0:55:01.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko ang lahat para matulungan kang mahanap ang iyong anak,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.83,0:55:03.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na hinahanap-hanap mo
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.00,0:55:08.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko si Boo Young na pinuno ng Jinyoung, at si Jo Young ang magiging reyna
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.00,0:55:10.00,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya pakiusap,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.09,0:55:11.92,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,wag mo siyang ipasa bilang Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.46,0:55:15.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Kumusta ang kapatid mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.47,0:55:19.93,general text,,0,0,0,,pagiging Gwangju Jeonbugwan, susuportahan ko si Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.39,0:55:23.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung tutuusin, miyembro ako ng Jin family
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.70,0:55:41.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Makinig, Yul, iyon ang kakaiba
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.37,0:55:44.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo naisip si Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.70,0:55:47.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko siya inisip
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.58,0:55:51.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko rin maintindihan kung bakit ipinakita ng salamin si Moo Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.17,0:55:54.21,general text,,0,0,0,,- At iyong mga salita niya...\N- Ano ang sinabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.96,0:55:56.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.21,0:55:57.59,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Talagang papunta na kami doon
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.22,0:56:00.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Ano ang iniisip mo diyan? Ano ang nakakatakot sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.64,0:56:07.02,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Lahat ay maayos
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.85,0:56:11.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Banal na espiritu
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.52,0:56:15.90,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Cart na may mga parsela
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.65,0:56:20.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Malamang, ang mga regalo sa kasal ni Cho Young ay ihahatid sa Sosnovy Bor ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.70,0:56:23.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Walang makakakita sa kanila
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.66,0:56:26.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Kailangan natin siyang tulungan
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.09,0:56:41.55,italics,,0,0,0,,Ibon! Hulihin ang ibon!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.64,0:56:42.93,general text,,0,0,0,,- Ano ito?\N- Catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.60,0:56:44.97,italics,,0,0,0,,- Ano ito!\N- Saan siya lumipad?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.64,0:56:48.18,italics,,0,0,0,,- Doon! \N- Nandiyan siya!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.27,0:56:50.81,italics,,0,0,0,,- Paano ito?\N- Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.77,0:56:53.94,italics,,0,0,0,,- Hoy\N- Doon
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.10,0:57:29.98,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Nakabisado ni Nak Su ang alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.27,0:57:36.15,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Kung umalis ang kaluluwa niya sa katawan niya, baka buhay pa siya
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.99,0:57:46.12,memories,,0,0,0,,Namiss mo yung nakilala mo sa Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.87,0:57:49.70,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Patuloy na isipin siya
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.46,0:57:52.79,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay muli akong lalapit sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.37,0:57:58.17,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ang taglamig sa Danhyangok ay mas mainit kaysa sa iyong iniisip
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.17,0:58:02.47,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Kung saan sumisikat ang araw, mabilis na natutunaw ang niyebe
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.60,0:58:10.89,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,So, Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.18,0:58:13.52,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ito si Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.87,0:59:18.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang nag-iwan ng spirit amulet sa Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.30,0:59:26.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Kaya buhay ka, Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.07,0:59:50.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.74,0:59:52.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Pagod na akong maghintay sayo
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.03,0:59:54.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi sinabi sa iyo ni Servant Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.70,0:59:56.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Dapat ay tanghali ka nang dumating
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.12,1:00:00.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Bilisan natin. Kailangan nating makarating sa Danhyangok bago lumubog ang araw
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.04,1:00:02.38,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa halip na Danhyangok,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.42,1:00:05.84,general text,,0,0,0,,punta tayo sa ibang lugar
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.01,1:00:08.09,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Saan?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.13,1:00:11.72,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa silangan ay may isang walang laman na templo malapit sa isang kagubatan ng kawayan
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.22,1:00:13.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Pwede tayong pumunta doon
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.64,1:00:21.98,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Dalhin doon si Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.06,1:00:23.61,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay ililigtas ko ang iyong buhay
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.45,1:00:31.28,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Kailangan kitang ipasa para mabuhay
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.07,1:00:33.28,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Ganyan dapat
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.08,1:00:37.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako ikakasal
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.54,1:00:40.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Binigyan ko sila ng dahilan para tanggihan ang aking kandidatura
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.50,1:00:42.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Ganun ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.38,1:00:44.42,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pero...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.59,1:00:50.30,general text,,0,0,0,,natanggap na ng maid Kim ang yin-yang jade
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.97,1:00:52.68,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya gumawa ako ng isang bagay mula dito
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.10,1:01:01.85,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Ito ay mga itlog ng ibon\N- Tama
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.52,1:01:03.98,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kunin ang isa. Magkakaroon tayo ng tig-iisa
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.94,1:01:10.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Meron kaming kakaibang relasyon
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.32,1:01:13.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Ang young master at ang maid. Guro at mag-aaral
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.11,1:01:15.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya naisip ko na maaari nilang ipaalala sa amin iyon
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.95,1:01:18.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,upang manatili tayong tapat sa isa't isa
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.21,1:01:23.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Ako ang unang pipili
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.54,1:01:25.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Kukunin ko red, blue ang kukunin mo
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.76,1:01:33.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Guro, manatiling tapat tayo sa isa't isa
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.81,1:01:42.81,general text,,0,0,0,,- Chan Wook\N- Oo?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.36,1:01:46.98,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dito tayo paalam
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.36,1:01:53.32,general text,,0,0,0,,babalik ako sa pinanggalingan ko
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.57,1:01:58.49,general text,,0,0,0,,- Pero iniwan ka nila\N{\i1}- Ngayon ko ulit sila nakilala
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.12,1:02:00.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Kilala nila kung sino ako
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.45,1:02:03.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Kaya hiniling nila na bumalik ako sa kanila
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.29,1:02:06.13,general text,,0,0,0,,- Akala ko gusto ka nilang patayin\N- As you can see, I'm still alive
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.75,1:02:09.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung gusto nilang pumatay, matagal na silang nakapatay
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.80,1:02:13.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung babalik ako, maibabalik ko ang aking lakas
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.56,1:02:22.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Nangako akong tutulungan kita...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.02,1:02:25.65,general text,,0,0,0,,At sinabi kong itutulak kita sa bangin
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.86,1:02:30.11,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Alam kong sinanay kita ng husto,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.19,1:02:33.36,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at ginawa mo ang lahat sa iyong kapangyarihan
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.70,1:02:37.12,general text,,0,0,0,,- Maaari tayong magpatuloy...\N- Hindi
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:40.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung magkadikit tayo, mamamatay ka
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.99,1:02:42.58,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,At mahuhuli ako
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.89,1:03:08.06,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang dahilan kung bakit lihim na pumunta rito ang pinuno ng Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.15,1:03:09.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong magtanong
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.27,1:03:14.32,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,tungkol sa mago ni Jeonbugwan na nagngangalang Cho Chun, na namatay 20 taon na ang nakakaraan
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.74,1:03:21.53,italics,,0,0,0,,Father Nak Soo, Cho Chun,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.45,1:03:23.62,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,pinagkadalubhasaan ang alchemy ng mga kaluluwa
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.62,1:03:27.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Nang matagpuan namin siya,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.08,1:03:30.34,general text,,0,0,0,,naligaw na siya
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.42,1:03:34.34,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at pinatay ang kanyang buong pamilya
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.30,1:03:43.43,italics,,0,0,0,,Kailangang magkasya ang apat na pamilya,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.14,1:03:45.77,italics,,0,0,0,,para matigil ang pagdanak ng dugo
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.11,1:03:55.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Nomad din ang tatay ni Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:03:58.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa mata ng isang bata,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.28,1:04:01.78,general text,,0,0,0,,malamang kami ang mga pumatay sa kanyang ama
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.99,1:04:07.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Siguradong sinisi niya tayo sa pagkamatay niya
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.87,1:04:10.46,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at kaya ako pumunta sa Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.75,1:04:15.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Anong mahalagang isyu ang gusto mong talakayin?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.76,1:04:18.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Naaalala mo ba ang tungkol kay Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.76,1:04:25.89,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Kung magkita tayong muli, papatayin kita
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.98,1:04:32.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pahiwatig,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.94,1:04:36.23,general text,,0,0,0,,na kinuha ko ang anak ni Cho Chun sa ilalim ng aking pakpak at ginawa siyang mersenaryo?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.32,1:04:39.61,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sinunog mo ang kanyang katawan nang matagpuan mo ito
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.70,1:04:42.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi para itago ang identity niya?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.66,1:04:48.41,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa halip na sagutin, sasabihin ko sa iyo ang tungkol sa nangyari 20 taon na ang nakakaraan
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.04,1:04:53.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Dito sa Jeonbugwan nire-record namin ang mga bituin...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.04,1:04:56.30,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,mula ala-una ng umaga hanggang alas-tres, kapag ang enerhiya ay nasa tuktok nito
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.42,1:05:00.93,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Sinusuri ni Gwangju ang recording sa tanghali, naka-imbak dito ang mga sign
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.30,1:05:07.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Isang araw nawala ang sign na nakasulat sa umagang iyon
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.27,1:05:12.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Mabuti na lang at nahanap namin siya
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.19,1:05:17.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kailan ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.70,1:05:25.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Ang araw na namatay ang asawa ni Chang Gang na si Do Hwa at ipinanganak si Chang Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.74,1:05:28.79,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Isinulat ni Cho Chun ang mga bituin noong araw na iyon,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.87,1:05:32.42,general text,,0,0,0,,at ako ang nakakita ng nawawalang sign
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.72,1:05:49.22,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Nagawa kong nakawin ang totoong sign
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.31,1:05:52.60,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Sa Jeonbugwan, isang pekeng walang star ng Hari
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.19,1:05:59.78,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang sabihin,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.46,1:06:01.90,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ano ang alam mo
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.03,1:06:04.99,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,tungkol sa nangyari noong...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.87,1:06:08.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Isinilang ba si Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.83,1:06:15.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Isang bituin na handang baguhin ang mundo ay lumitaw sa kalangitan
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.34,1:06:23.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba ang tungkol sa bituin ng Hari?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.09,1:06:25.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Akala mo ba mamamatay ang sikreto kasama si Cho Chun?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.55,1:06:30.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Sino sa palagay mo ang naging kaluluwang lumulunok sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.02,1:06:36.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Huwag magtanong na hindi mo gustong malaman ang sagot
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.85,1:06:40.02,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ang tanging paraan na mapoprotektahan mo si Sosnovy Bor at ang mga naninirahan dito
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.83,1:06:56.00,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Hindi alam ni Dan Joo na buhay ka pa, Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.88,1:06:59.38,memories,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko sinabi sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.21,1:07:01.67,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Dalhin si Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.75,1:07:03.72,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay itikom ko ang aking bibig
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.26,1:07:10.72,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ililipat ko ang aking kaluluwa sa kanyang katawan
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.24,1:07:31.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Nasaan si Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.37,1:07:33.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Malapit na siyang dumating
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.42,1:07:43.00,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nagdadala sa iyo dito sa ganoong oras?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.47,1:07:47.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bago ipinanganak si Uk...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.09,1:07:51.35,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mga 20 taon na ang nakalipas...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.43,1:07:52.72,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pwede bang si Chang Gan...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.97,1:07:56.06,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,master ang isang partikular na uri ng magic?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.40,1:08:00.77,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Nagawa ni Chan Gan...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.27,1:08:04.11,general text,,0,0,0,,relocate the soul?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.58,1:08:21.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit ang tagal nito?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.55,1:08:26.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa wakas ay nagsisimula nang umulan
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.96,1:08:28.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Nandito siya ngayon
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.55,1:08:33.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Niloko mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.22,1:08:38.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Ano pang hinihintay mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.81,1:08:42.90,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dahil hindi pa rin lumitaw si Dan Zhu,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.98,1:08:45.57,general text,,0,0,0,,kaya wala ka talagang sinabi sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.28,1:08:48.57,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Oh ikaw...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.97,1:09:14.30,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,Dito tayo paalam
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.35,1:09:18.56,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Paano ang walang laman na templo sa kagubatan?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.23,1:09:22.85,memories,,0,0,0,,Bakit ayaw mo akong isama?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.94,1:09:25.02,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,papaalisin sana kita doon para mailigtas ang sarili ko
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.86,1:09:28.90,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ngayon alam mo na, huwag mo nang isipin ang pagsunod sa akin
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.65,1:09:32.49,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon hindi mo dapat sinabi sa akin ang tungkol sa templong iyon
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.70,1:09:35.74,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Hayaan kang umalis mag-isa,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.53,1:09:38.54,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,alam mong delikado doon?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.79,1:09:43.29,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,mas masama ang pakiramdam ko ngayon kaysa sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.37,1:09:45.92,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Na-miss ko ang pagkakataon sa buhay dahil sa ilang itlog ng ibon
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.00,1:09:48.13,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Natutuwa akong mapaalalahanan ka ng debosyon
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.21,1:09:49.76,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Mamamatay na talaga ako
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.68,1:09:55.72,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,tinulungan kitang maiwasan ang kamatayan,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.97,1:09:59.10,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,kaya lumaban hanggang kamatayan
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.18,1:10:03.85,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Pagsasalita na parang niligtas mo ako
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.35,1:10:08.02,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Kung ang maulap na kalangitan ay pagpalain tayo ng ulan,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.69,1:10:11.74,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,tapos pareho tayong mabubuhay
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.54,1:10:22.29,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang suwerte at katotohanan ay nasa iyong panig, Uk
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.83,1:10:24.58,general text,,0,0,0,,May malakas na ulan sa labas
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.50,1:10:27.71,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko hindi gaanong mas malakas ang kalaban ko kaysa sa akin
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.96,1:10:30.59,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Siya ay isang salamangkero mula sa Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.67,1:10:32.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kumusta. Naaalala mo ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.27,1:12:48.68,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Eto na. Ngayon na ang oras para gumamit ng tansu
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.77,1:12:52.06,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Huwag subukang hatiin ang mga patak gamit ang isang hindi nakokontrol na espada,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.15,1:12:54.44,offscreen,,0,0,0,,hawakan mo ang espada para mahulog dito ang mga patak
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.58,1:13:53.79,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.50,1:13:58.80,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang problema?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.88,1:13:59.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Alchemy of Souls
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.10,1:14:53.43,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Ang aking kaluluwa...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.02,1:14:55.52,offscreen,,0,0,0,,moving now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.00,1:15:18.42,preview,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.75,1:15:23.46,preview,,0,0,0,,Kaya nagpalit kayo ng katawan sa estudyante kong si Gil Joo
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.55,1:15:26.09,preview,,0,0,0,,I think naging biktima ng transmigration of souls si Uk
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.18,1:15:27.09,preview,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.18,1:15:29.68,preview,,0,0,0,,Ang lalaking nagpalipat-lipat sa kaluluwa ng aking ama...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.76,1:15:31.89,preview,,0,0,0,,si Jin Moo ba ito mula kay Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.93,1:15:36.44,preview,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ba yan? ikaw di ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.52,1:15:39.69,preview,,0,0,0,,Sigurado ka bang nawasak ang ice stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.31,1:15:42.65,preview,,0,0,0,,Order all our magicians to find Gil Zhu
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.73,1:15:45.15,preview,,0,0,0,,Dapat manatiling lihim na sila ay mga nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.15,1:15:47.15,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,
